Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.53,0:02:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's beautiful here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.38,0:02:40.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was our aunt's。We used to come here as kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.06,0:02:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Order uses it now as a safe house.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.11,0:02:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's left of us at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.48,0:02:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Muggles think these things keep evil away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.84,0:02:53.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,But they're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.92,0:02:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,I need to talk to the Goblin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.87,0:03:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,How are you？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.16,0:03:14.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.81,0:03:20.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,You probably don't remember that you…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.77,0:03:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,That I showed you to your vault，the first time you came to Gringotts.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.68,0:03:28.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Even amongst Goblins，you are famous Harry Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.06,0:03:34.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You buried the elf？- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.47,0:03:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,And brought me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.17,0:03:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,You are…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.70,0:03:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pretty unusual，is it？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.27,0:03:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,How did you come by the sword？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.14,0:04:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.68,0:04:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why did Bellatrix Lestrange think it should be in her vault at Gringotts？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.67,0:04:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.93,0:04:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,The sword presented itself to us，in moment of need.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.76,0:04:18.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,We didn't steal it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.25,0:04:24.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,There is a sword in Madam Lestrange's vault identical to this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.92,0:04:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,But it is a fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.40,0:04:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was placed there this past summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.69,0:04:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,And she never suspected it was a fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.48,0:04:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,The replica is very convincing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.83,0:04:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Only a goblin would recognize that this is the true Sword of Gryffindor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.92,0:04:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who is the acquaintance？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.86,0:04:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,A Hogwarts Professor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.18,0:04:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,As I understand that he's now Headmaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.14,0:04:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Snape.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.22,0:04:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,He put a fake sword in Bellatrix's vault.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.88,0:04:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.20,0:04:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,There are more than a few curious things in the vaults at Gringotts.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.35,0:04:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,And in Madam Lestrange's vault as well？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.02,0:05:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.71,0:05:08.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,I need to get into Gringotts。Into one of the vaults.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.94,0:05:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It is impossible。- Alone，yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.81,0:05:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,But with you，no.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.91,0:05:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Why should I help you？- I have gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.60,0:05:23.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lots of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.80,0:05:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've no interest in gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.62,0:05:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then what？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.05,0:05:33.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,That.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.99,0:05:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,That is my price.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.37,0:05:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you thinking there's a Horcrux in Bellatrix's vault？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.08,0:05:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，she was terrified when she thought we had been in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.45,0:05:56.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,She kept asking you，what else was taken？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.45,0:05:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,I bet you anything，there's Horcrux in there。Another piece of his soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.83,0:06:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's find it，kill it，and we are one step closer to killing him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.27,0:06:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,And what happens when we find it，
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.41,0:06:07.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,How're we supposed to destroy it，now you're giving the sword to Griphook？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.56,0:06:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm still working on that part.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.92,0:06:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.84,0:06:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.64,0:06:28.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Ollivander
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.95,0:06:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,I need to ask you a few questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.14,0:06:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Anything，m'boy。Anything！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.10,0:06:39.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Would you mind identifying this wand？We need to know if it's safe to use.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.98,0:06:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uhh… Walnut
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.97,0:06:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dragon Heartstring
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.08,0:06:55.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,12 and three quarter inches.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.82,0:06:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Unyie…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.74,0:07:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Unyielding.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.60,0:07:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,This belonged to Bellatrix Lestrange.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.03,0:07:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Try this carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.57,0:07:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,And this？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.35,0:07:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hawthorn.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.38,0:07:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,An unicorn hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.15,0:07:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,10 inches.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.35,0:07:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Reasonably pliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.22,0:07:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,This was the wand of Draco Malfoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.69,0:07:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Was？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.10,0:07:37.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is it not still？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.28,0:07:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，perhaps not。If you won it from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.88,0:07:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,I sense its allegiance has changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.88,0:07:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,You talk about wands，as if they have feelings…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.00,0:08:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,…can think！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.65,0:08:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,The wand chooses the wizard，Mr。Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.61,0:08:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,That much has always been clear to those of us who've studied wandlore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.38,0:08:18.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,And，what do you know about the Deathly Hallows？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.27,0:08:25.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,It is rumored there are three.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.51,0:08:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Elder Wand，the Cloak of Invisibility，to hide you from your enemies…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.18,0:08:41.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,and the Resurrection Stone，to bring back loved ones from the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.12,0:08:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Together，they make one the Master of Death.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.75,0:08:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,But few，truly believe that such objects exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.76,0:08:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.02,0:08:57.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you believe they exist，sir？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.99,0:09:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.53,0:09:07.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,I see no reason to put stock into an old wives' tale.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.68,0:09:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're lying！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.21,0:09:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know one exists.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.66,0:09:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,You told him about it。You told him about the Elder Wand…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.30,0:09:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,and where he could go looking for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.76,0:09:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,He tortured me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.41,0:09:30.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Besides…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.44,0:09:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,…I only conveyed rumors.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.67,0:09:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.57,0:09:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's no telling whether he will find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.64,0:09:47.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,He has found it，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.31,0:09:55.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,We'll let you rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.83,0:10:00.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's after you，Mr。Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.66,0:10:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,If it's true what you say，
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.71,0:10:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,that he has the Elder Wand，
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.55,0:10:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm afraid，
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.75,0:10:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,…you really don't stand a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.91,0:10:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，I suppose I'll have to kill him，before he finds me，then.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.69,0:10:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're sure that's hers？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.48,0:10:28.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Positive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.03,0:10:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.78,0:10:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,How do I look？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.99,0:10:41.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hideous.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.40,0:10:45.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can give that to Hermione to hold。Alright，Griphook？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.45,0:11:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're relying on you，Griphook.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.88,0:11:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you get us past the guards into the vault…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.00,0:11:10.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,The sword's yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.00,0:11:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Madam Lestrange.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.95,0:11:26.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.77,0:11:31.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good morning？Good morning？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.77,0:11:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're Bellatrix Lestrange，not some school girl！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.96,0:11:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey！Easy！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.50,0:11:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,If she gives us away，we must swear to use that sword to slit our own throats.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.59,0:11:42.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Understand？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.82,0:11:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，he's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.16,0:11:46.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,I speak stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.53,0:11:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay。Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.27,0:12:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,I wish to enter my vault.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.49,0:13:03.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Identification？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.94,0:13:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,I hardly think that would be necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.98,0:13:13.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Madam Lestrange.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.02,0:13:21.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't like to be kept waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.86,0:13:23.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.57,0:13:25.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,They know she's an impostor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.66,0:13:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,They'd be warned.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.34,0:13:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.67,0:13:42.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,What do we do，Harry？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.18,0:13:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Madam Lestrange，would you mind presenting your wand？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.73,0:13:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,And why should I do that？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.64,0:13:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's the bank's policy！I'm sure you understand，given current climate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.36,0:14:03.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！I most certainly do not understand！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.46,0:14:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm afraid，I must insist.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.84,0:14:14.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Imperio！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.04,0:14:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Very well，Madam Lestrange.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.60,0:14:24.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you will follow me？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.65,0:15:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,What is that，Griphook？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.63,0:15:07.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Griphook！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.85,0:15:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aresto Momentum
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.29,0:15:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well done，Hermione.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.06,0:15:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh no，you two're like you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.67,0:15:49.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Thief's Downfall，washes away all enchantments.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.57,0:15:50.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can be deadly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.85,0:15:52.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,You don't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.79,0:15:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just out of interest，is there any other way out of here？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.86,0:15:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.76,0:16:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,What the devil are all you doing down here？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.43,0:16:03.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thieves！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.10,0:16:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,You gave up the…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.72,0:16:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Imperio - You！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.25,0:16:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,That doesn't sound good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.53,0:16:30.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bloody hell！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.13,0:16:32.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's an Ukrainian Ironbelly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.88,0:16:33.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.07,0:16:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's been trained to expect pain when it hears the noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.77,0:16:49.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's barbaric！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.66,0:17:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lumos
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.65,0:17:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Blimey！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.65,0:17:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Accio Horcrux
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.15,0:17:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,You seem you're gonna try that one to get over here？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.50,0:17:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,No kind of magic would work in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.37,0:17:48.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's in here，Harry？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.13,0:17:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can you feel anything？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.29,0:18:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's it！Up there！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.36,0:18:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,They have added the Gemino curse。Everything you touch will multiply.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.04,0:18:24.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Give me the sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.29,0:18:43.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop moving！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.69,0:19:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do it！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.53,0:19:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- We had deal，Griphook！- The cup for the sword！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.65,0:19:23.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,I said I'll get you in，I didn't say anything about getting you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.19,0:19:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Griphook！Thieves！Griphook！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.60,0:19:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，thieves！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.67,0:19:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is that okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.48,0:19:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,We've still got Bogrod.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.04,0:20:05.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's unfortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.63,0:20:11.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,We can't just stand here，You got any idea？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.15,0:20:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're the brilliant one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.63,0:20:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've got something，but it's mad！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.34,0:20:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Reducto
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.19,0:20:32.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，come on，then！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.33,0:20:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Relashio
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.91,0:21:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Keep moving！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.08,0:21:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now what？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.39,0:21:53.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Reducto
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.30,0:21:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.95,0:22:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,That was brilliant！Absolutely brilliant！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.39,0:22:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're dropping！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.02,0:22:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I say we jump！- When？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.51,0:22:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.40,0:23:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,He knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.74,0:23:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,You-Know-Who.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.48,0:23:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,He knows we broke into Gringotts.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.16,0:23:47.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,He knows what we took，and he knows we're hunting Horcruxes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.61,0:23:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- How is it you know？- I saw him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.44,0:23:53.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,You let him in？Harry，you can't do that！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.22,0:23:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hermione，I can't always help it！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.43,0:23:56.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，maybe I can。I don't know！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.03,0:23:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Never mind！What happened？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.41,0:24:00.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，he's angry…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.61,0:24:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,and scared too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.14,0:24:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,He knows，if we find and destroy all the Horcruxes，we'll be able to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.96,0:24:08.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,I reckon he'll stop at nothing to make sure we don't find the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.04,0:24:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,And there's more.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.88,0:24:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,One of them is at Hogwarts.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.27,0:24:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.39,0:24:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,You saw it？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.11,0:24:17.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,I saw the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.18,0:24:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,And Rowena Ravenclaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.33,0:24:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,It must have something to do with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.65,0:24:20.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,We have to go there，now！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.79,0:24:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，we can't do that！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.00,0:24:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,We've got to plan，we've got to figure it out！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.66,0:24:27.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hermione，when have any of our plans ever actually worked？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.36,0:24:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,We plan，we get there，all hell breaks loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.07,0:24:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's right！One problem…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.14,0:24:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Snape's Headmaster now，we can't just move from the front door！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.51,0:24:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，we'll go to Hogsmeade，
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.67,0:24:42.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,to Honeydukes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.07,0:24:43.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Take the secret passage in the cellar.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.82,0:24:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.82,0:24:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's something wrong with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.19,0:24:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's like，you know，in the past…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.67,0:24:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've always been able to follow his thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.36,0:24:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,And now everything just feels disconnected.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.84,0:24:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe it's the Horcruxes。Maybe he's growing weaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.07,0:24:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe he's dying！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.14,0:24:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.01,0:25:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，it's… it's more like he's wounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.79,0:25:04.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,If anything，he feels more dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.50,0:25:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Right here。Come on！- Search everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.77,0:25:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go，move！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.00,0:26:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Faster！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.98,0:26:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,In here，Potter。Come on，move！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.24,0:26:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did you look at him？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.90,0:26:50.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- For a second I thought that was… - I know。Dumbledore！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.44,0:27:08.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.05,0:27:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can see you in this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.93,0:27:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bloody fools，what were you thinking，coming here？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.12,0:27:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Have you any idea how dangerous it is？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.78,0:27:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're Aberforth，Dumbledore's brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.03,0:27:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's you who I've been seeing in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.64,0:27:40.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're the one who sent Dobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.38,0:27:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Why've you left him？- He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.05,0:27:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry to hear it。I liked that elf.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.13,0:27:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who gave that to you？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.49,0:27:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,The mirror？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.56,0:27:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mundungus Fletcher，'bout a year ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.20,0:27:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dung had no right selling that to you。It belongs to…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.82,0:27:54.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sirius…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.85,0:27:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Albus told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.32,0:28:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,He also told me you'd likely be hacked off，
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.00,0:28:04.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,…if you ever found that I had it。But，ask yourself;
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.12,0:28:06.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where would you be if I didn't？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.80,0:28:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you have any others much？From the Order？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.30,0:28:14.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Order's finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.75,0:28:16.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,You-Know-Who's won，
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.22,0:28:20.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,…anyone who says otherwise is killing themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.93,0:28:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,We need to get into Hogwarts，tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.86,0:28:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dumbledore gave us a job to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.72,0:28:26.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did he now…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.64,0:28:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nice job？Easy？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.70,0:28:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,We've been hunting Horcruxes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.25,0:28:35.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,And we think the last one's inside the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.39,0:28:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,But we'll need your help getting in.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.49,0:28:40.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Which job my brother has given you no，it's a suicide mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.68,0:28:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do yourself a favor，boy。Go home！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.27,0:28:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Live a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.18,0:28:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dumbledore trusted me to see this through.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.79,0:28:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,What makes you think you can trust him？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.32,0:28:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,What makes you think you can believe anything my brother told you？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.84,0:28:53.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,And in all the time you knew him…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.54,0:28:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did he ever mention my name？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.95,0:28:58.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did he ever mentioned hers？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.94,0:29:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Why should he… - Keep secrets.You tell me？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.63,0:29:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I trusted him。- That's a boy's answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.39,0:29:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,A boy goes chasing Horcruxes on the word of a man who wouldn't even tell him where to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.33,0:29:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're lying！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.02,0:29:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not just on me，that doesn't matter。To yourself as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.06,0:29:19.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's what a fool does.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.34,0:29:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,You don't strike me as a fool，Harry Potter！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.82,0:29:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，I'll ask you again，there must be a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.79,0:29:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not interested in what happened between you and your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.99,0:29:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't care that you've given up.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.61,0:29:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,I trusted the man I knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.32,0:29:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,We need to get into the castle tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.92,0:29:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.41,0:30:04.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where've you sent her？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.75,0:30:05.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,You'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.45,0:30:08.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.97,0:30:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's your sister，Ariana。Isn't it？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.50,0:30:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,She died very young，didn't she？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.33,0:30:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,My brother sacrificed many things，Mr。Potter.On his journey to find power.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.32,0:30:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Including Ariana.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.52,0:30:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,And she was devoted to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.90,0:30:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,He gave her everything，
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.40,0:30:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,…but time.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.49,0:30:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you，Mr。Dumbledore.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.83,0:30:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,He did save our lives twice！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.88,0:30:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kept an eye on us on that mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.42,0:30:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,That doesn't seem like someone who's given up！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.12,0:31:07.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.53,0:31:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's that with her？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.43,0:31:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Neville！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.53,0:31:20.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- How you look… - Like hell，I reckon.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.65,0:31:22.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.98,0:31:24.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Seamus is worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.02,0:31:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Ab！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.14,0:31:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,We've got a couple more coming through.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.42,0:31:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't remember this on the Marauder's Map.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.43,0:31:33.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's because it never existed till now.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.25,0:31:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,The seven secret passages were sealed off，before the start of the year.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.14,0:31:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is the only way in or out，now.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.77,0:31:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,The grounds are crawled with Death Eaters and Dementors.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.00,0:31:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,How about Mr.Snape as Headmaster？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.78,0:31:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hardly ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.87,0:31:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's the Carrows who's watch out for.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.04,0:31:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Carrows？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.99,0:31:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。Brother and sister。Incharge of discipline.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.59,0:31:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,They like punishment，the Carrows.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.24,0:31:53.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,They did that to you？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.98,0:31:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.84,0:31:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Today's Dark Arts lesson was practicing the Cruciatus curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.03,0:31:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,On first years.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.64,0:32:02.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,I refused.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.52,0:32:04.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hogwarts has changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.24,0:32:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's have a bit of fun，shall we？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.81,0:32:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，listen up you lot！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.84,0:32:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've for you a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.34,0:32:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,No more Aberforth's cook gonna help.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.66,0:32:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,We'll be surprised if we can digest that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.90,0:32:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Oh my！- Harry！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.25,0:32:54.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get the word out to Remus and the others，that Harry is back.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.42,0:32:56.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，okay！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.65,0:32:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's not kill him before You-Know-Who does.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.09,0:33:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,…Do you read？We've a new weather report.Lightning has struck.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.22,0:33:02.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,I repeat：Lightning has struck.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.81,0:33:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's the fun，Harry？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.23,0:33:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.34,0:33:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's something we need to find.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.79,0:33:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Something hidden here，in the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.12,0:33:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,And it may help us to defeat You-Know-Who.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.84,0:33:22.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Alright，what is it？- We don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.92,0:33:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Where is it？- We don't know that either.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.26,0:33:29.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,I realize there's not much to go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.56,0:33:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's nothing to go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.48,0:33:33.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think it has something to do with Ravenclaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.16,0:33:38.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,It'll be small，easily concealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.74,0:33:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Anyone，any ideas？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.43,0:33:45.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，there's Rowena Ravenclaw's lost diadem.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.70,0:33:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，bloody hell！Here we go！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.61,0:33:50.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lost diadem of Ravenclaw？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.28,0:33:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hasn't anyone heard of this？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.33,0:33:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's quite famous.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.84,0:33:56.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes。But，Luna，it's lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.83,0:34:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,For centuries。There's no person alive today who's seen it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.42,0:34:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excuse me，can someone tell me what bloody diadem is？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.86,0:34:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a sort of crown.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.04,0:34:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，like a tiara.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.77,0:34:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.22,0:34:13.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hi，there.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.06,0:34:19.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Six months she doesn't see me and it's like I'm a frankie first-year.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.92,0:34:20.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm her brother！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.19,0:34:23.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- She's got lots of them，but she's got only one Harry。- Shut up，Seamus！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.42,0:34:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,What is it，Ginny？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.19,0:34:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Snape knows… he knows that Harry was spotted in Hogsmeade.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.34,0:35:14.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Many of you are surely wondering，why I have summoned you at this hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.54,0:35:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's come to my attention，that earlier this evening…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.68,0:35:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry Potter was sighted in Hogsmeade.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.42,0:35:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.18,0:35:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,should anyone…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.46,0:35:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,student or staff attempt to aid Mr。Potter？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.97,0:35:47.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,They will be punished in a manner consistent with the severity of their transcription，further more…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.36,0:35:52.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Any person found to have knowledge of these events…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.40,0:35:57.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,who fails to come forward…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.32,0:36:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,…will be treated as equally guilty.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.04,0:36:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Another…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.35,0:36:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,If anyone in here has any knowledge of Mr。Potter's movements this evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.35,0:36:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,I invite them to step forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.58,0:36:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.83,0:36:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,It seems，despite your exhaustive defensive strategies，
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.96,0:36:56.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,…you still have a bit of security problem，Headmaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.43,0:37:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm afraid it's quite extensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.96,0:37:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,How dare you stand where he stood？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.64,0:37:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tell them how it happened that night？Tell them how you looked him in the eye…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.73,0:37:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,A man who trusted you，and killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.34,0:37:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tell them！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.46,0:37:54.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.52,0:37:56.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Potter？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.76,0:38:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know that many of you will want to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.17,0:38:41.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Some of you may even think that to fight is wise.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.72,0:38:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,But this is folly.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.52,0:38:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Give me Harry Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.48,0:38:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do this and none shall be harmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.67,0:38:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Give me Harry Potter，and I shall leave Hogwarts untouched.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.16,0:39:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Give me Harry Potter，and you will be rewarded.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.03,0:39:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,You have one hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.38,0:39:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,What're you waiting for？Someone grab him！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.39,0:39:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Students out of bed！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.90,0:39:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Students in the corridor！- They're supposed to be out of bed，
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.15,0:39:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,you blithering idiot！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.18,0:39:47.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.80,0:39:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,As it happens，Mr。Filch…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.27,0:39:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your arrival is most opportune.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.81,0:39:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you would，I would like you please，to lead Miss Parkinson
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.81,0:39:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,and the rest of Slytherin house，from the hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.51,0:40:01.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Exactly where is it I'll be leading 'em to，ma'am？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.40,0:40:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,The dungeons would do.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.78,0:40:11.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,I presume you have a reason for returning，Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.60,0:40:12.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,What is it you need？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.41,0:40:15.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Time，Professor。As much as you can get me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.50,0:40:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do what you have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.08,0:40:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll secure the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.49,0:40:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Potter…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.99,0:40:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.72,0:40:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's good to see you too，Professor.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.04,0:40:31.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hold the fort，Neville.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.87,0:40:44.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.71,0:40:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hermione and I've been thinking，it doesn't matter if we find a Horcrux.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.81,0:40:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,What do you mean？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.77,0:40:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Unless we can destroy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.21,0:40:51.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，we were thinking…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.66,0:40:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，Ron was thinking，it was Ron's idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.04,0:40:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's completely brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.34,0:40:56.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,You destroyed Tom Riddle's diary with a Basilisk's fang，right？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.04,0:41:00.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，me and Hermione did remind where we might find one.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.28,0:41:01.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.87,0:41:03.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，but take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.17,0:41:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,That way，you can find me when you get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.00,0:41:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where're you going？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.53,0:41:09.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ravenclaw common room，Gotta start somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.83,0:41:18.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry！Harry！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.36,0:41:20.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let me get this straight，Professor…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.90,0:41:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're actually giving us permission to do this？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.74,0:41:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,That is correct，Longbottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.10,0:41:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,To blow it up！Boom！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.84,0:41:27.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Boom！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.14,0:41:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wicked！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.75,0:41:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,But how on earth are we gonna do that？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.33,0:41:34.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why don't you confer with Mr。Finnigan？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.30,0:41:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,As I recall，he has a particular proclivity for pyro-technics.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.46,0:41:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can bring it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.72,0:41:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's the spirit！Away，you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.04,0:41:46.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,You do realize，of course，we can't keep out You-Know-Who indefinitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.33,0:41:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,That doesn't mean we can't delay him.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.41,0:41:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,And his name is Voldemort。Filius，you might as well use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.22,0:41:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's come to try to kill you，either way！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.32,0:42:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Piertotum Locomotor.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.71,0:42:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hogwarts is threatened.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.12,0:42:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Man the boundaries！Protect us。Do your duty…to our school.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.24,0:42:33.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've always wanted to use that spell！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.26,0:42:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Protego MaximaFianto Duri
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.68,0:42:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Repello InimigotumProtego Maxima
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.38,0:42:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Repello…Fianto DuriRepello Inimigotum
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.50,0:43:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry，wait！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.88,0:43:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I need to talk to you！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.64,0:43:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'm a bit pre-occupied at the moment，Luna。- You don't know anything where you're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.02,0:43:32.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're wasting your time！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.56,0:43:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，we'll talk later，okay，Luna？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.51,0:43:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Harry？- Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.64,0:43:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry Potter，you listen to me right now！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.24,0:43:43.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you remember what Cho said about Rowena Ravenclaw's diadem？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.20,0:43:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,There is not a person alive who's seen it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.01,0:43:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's obvious，isn't it？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.29,0:43:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,We have to talk to someone who's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.78,0:44:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's very impressive，isn't it？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.39,0:44:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you've to find her，you'll find her down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.83,0:44:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Aren't you coming？- No.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.41,0:44:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think it's best if you two talk alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.64,0:44:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's very shy.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.26,0:44:57.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're the Grey Lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.22,0:44:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,The ghost of Ravenclaw tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.72,0:45:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,I do not answer to that name！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.00,0:45:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，I'm sorry，I'm sorry！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.86,0:45:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's Helena，isn't it？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.17,0:45:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Helena Ravenclaw，Rowena's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.39,0:45:11.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you a friend of Luna's？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.11,0:45:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.04,0:45:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,And she thought you might be able to help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.81,0:45:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,You seek my mother's diadem？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.44,0:45:23.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.84,0:45:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.16,0:45:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Luna is kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.84,0:45:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Unlike so many of the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.23,0:45:35.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,But she was wrong，I cannot help you！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.00,0:45:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait，please！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.54,0:45:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want to destroy it！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.52,0:46:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,They never learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.43,0:46:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Such a pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.81,0:46:32.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,But，my Lord…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.37,0:46:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shouldn't we wait？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.72,0:46:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Begin！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.56,0:47:09.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,I thought you want to do it。Isn't it，Helena？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.50,0:47:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,You want to destroy it？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.25,0:47:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Another swore to destroy it，many years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.61,0:47:20.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,A strange boy with a strange name.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.11,0:47:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tom Riddle.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.55,0:47:22.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,But he lied.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.49,0:47:24.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's lied to many people.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.65,0:47:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know what he's done！I know who he is！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.96,0:47:31.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,He defiled it，with dark magic！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.97,0:47:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can destroy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.34,0:47:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.76,0:47:54.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,But only if you tell me where he hid it？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.74,0:47:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,You do know，where he hid it？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.63,0:48:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't you，Helena？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.07,0:48:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,You just have to tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.85,0:48:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.21,0:48:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Strange！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.43,0:48:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,You remind me of him a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.93,0:48:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's here，in the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.15,0:48:36.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,In the place where everything is hidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.29,0:48:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you have to ask…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.57,0:48:42.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,…you will never know.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.06,0:48:45.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you know…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.46,0:48:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,…you need only ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.98,0:48:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.62,0:49:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tell Professor McGonagall。Remus and I will handle this side of the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.63,0:49:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，sir！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.05,0:49:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey Dean，on second thoughts，tell Professor McGonagall
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.05,0:49:19.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,we might need one or two more wands this side.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.07,0:49:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,It is the quality of one's convictions that determine his success…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.07,0:49:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,…not the number of followers.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.74,0:49:29.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who said that？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.93,0:49:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.90,0:49:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,You okay，Freddie？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.27,0:49:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.42,0:49:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.13,0:50:01.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry talks in his sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.85,0:50:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you know this？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.84,0:50:06.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，of course，not！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.09,0:50:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah？You and whose army？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.33,0:51:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,You do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.04,0:51:20.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I can't。- Yes，you can！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.21,0:54:21.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Neville！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.21,0:54:39.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,That went well.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.95,0:55:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get inside！This way！Take cover！Take cover
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.85,0:55:56.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ginny，Neville！You alright？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.98,0:55:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Never better！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.20,0:55:59.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,I feel like I can spit fire！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.21,0:56:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Have you seen Luna up here？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.52,0:56:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Luna？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.89,0:56:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm mad for her。I think it about time I told her
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.81,0:56:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,since wel probably both be dead by dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.58,0:56:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.71,0:56:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bloody hell！We'll never find him on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.45,0:56:45.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here he is！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.21,0:56:46.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Just now… - Brilliant！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.21,0:56:48.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,He just vanished.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.71,0:56:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,I just now I saw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.54,0:56:55.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe he's gone to the Room of Requirement.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.51,0:56:56.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,It doesn't show up on the map，does it？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.98,0:56:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,You said that last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.55,0:57:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's right，I…I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.81,0:57:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.26,0:57:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Brilliant！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.37,0:57:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.16,0:59:06.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，well…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.63,0:59:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,What brings you here，Potter？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.35,0:59:11.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,I could ask you the same
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.83,0:59:14.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,You have something of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.92,0:59:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'd like it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.08,0:59:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's wrong with the one you have？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.57,0:59:19.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's my mother's.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.02,0:59:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's powerful，but it's…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.11,0:59:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,…not the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.21,0:59:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Doesn't quite understand me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.43,0:59:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know what I mean？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.04,0:59:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why didn't you tell her？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.86,0:59:35.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bellatrix？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.48,0:59:39.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,You knew it was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.74,0:59:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,You didn't say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.05,0:59:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，Draco！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.73,0:59:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't be a prat.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.52,0:59:47.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do it！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.87,0:59:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Easy！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.30,0:59:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Expelliarmus
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.86,0:59:54.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Avada Kedavra
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.23,0:59:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stupefy
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.67,1:00:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is my girlfriend，you bloody gits！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.09,1:00:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Got it！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.83,1:00:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,They've set the bloody place on fire！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.81,1:01:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on！This way！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.37,1:02:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,We can't leave them！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.81,1:02:02.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's joking，right？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.52,1:02:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,If we die for them，Harry，I'm gonna kill you！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.32,1:02:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.18,1:03:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,My Lord？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.81,1:03:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Avada Kedavra！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.78,1:03:40.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come Nagini，I need to keep you safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.03,1:03:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's the snake…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.26,1:03:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,…and she's the last one.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.67,1:03:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's the last Horcrux.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.03,1:04:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look inside him，Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.01,1:04:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Find out where he is，if you find him，we can find the snake.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.22,1:04:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,And we can end this！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.19,1:04:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,My Lord…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.73,1:04:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Might it be less…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.97,1:04:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,I should not be more prudent to call off this attack.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.79,1:04:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Simply seek the boy。Yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.09,1:04:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,I do not need to seek the boy…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.88,1:05:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,…before the night is out，he will come to me！Do you understand？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.35,1:05:06.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look at me！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.87,1:05:10.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,How can you live with yourself，Lucius？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.92,1:05:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.74,1:05:17.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go and find Severus.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.98,1:05:20.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bring him to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.39,1:05:30.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know where he is.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.51,1:05:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.82,1:06:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.14,1:07:21.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,You have performed extra-ordinary magic with this wand，My Lord，
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.26,1:07:23.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,…in the last few hours alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.23,1:07:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.76,1:07:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！I am extra-ordinary。But the wand resists me.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.17,1:07:39.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,There is no wand more powerful。Ollivander himself has said it.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.21,1:07:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tonight，when the boy comes。It will not fail you，I am sure of it…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.38,1:07:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,It answers to you，and you only.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.30,1:07:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Does it？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.63,1:08:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,My Lord？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.33,1:08:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,The wand，does it truly answer to me？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.45,1:08:10.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're a clever man，Severus.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.74,1:08:12.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Surely you must know…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.84,1:08:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Where does its true loyalty lie？- With you…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.82,1:08:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Of course，My Lord.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.21,1:08:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Elder Wand cannot serve me properly，because I am not its true master.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.26,1:08:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Elder Wand belongs to the wizard who killed its last owner.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.65,1:08:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,You killed Dumbledore，Severus.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.12,1:08:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,While you live，the Elder Wand cannot truly be mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.90,1:08:58.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,You've been a good and faithful servant，Severus.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.09,1:09:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,But only I can live forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.15,1:09:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,My Lord…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.84,1:09:16.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nagini，kill！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.31,1:10:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Take it… Take it up，please！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.72,1:10:28.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Give me something！Quickly，a flask。Anything！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.41,1:10:49.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Take them to the Pensieve.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.97,1:10:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look at me…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.07,1:11:01.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,You really have your mother's eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.47,1:11:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,You've fought valiantly，but in vain…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.91,1:11:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,I do not wish this。Every drop of magical blood spilled is a terrible waste.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.56,1:11:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,I，therefore command my forces to retreat…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.37,1:12:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,In their absence，dispose your dead with dignity，
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.97,1:12:12.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry Potter，I now speak directly to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.66,1:12:20.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,On this night，you have allowed your friends to die for you，rather than face me yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.03,1:12:27.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,There is no greater dishonor。Join me in the Forbidden Forrest…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.36,1:12:29.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,…and confront your fate.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.93,1:12:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you do not do this，I shall kill every last man，
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.93,1:12:44.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,woman and child who tries to conceal you from me.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.32,1:13:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where's everybody？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.11,1:13:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.18,1:13:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，come on！Don't be sad on it，
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.34,1:13:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,she's passed.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.83,1:13:46.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,There，she's gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.55,1:16:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Freak！Come here！I'm gonna tell mommy！You're freak！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.93,1:16:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're freak，Lily！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.86,1:16:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come here！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.82,1:16:29.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's jealous。She's ordinary and you're special.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.86,1:16:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's not true，Severus.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.45,1:16:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gryffindor！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.29,1:17:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hi，I'm James。- Hi，I'm Lily.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.34,1:17:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just like your father.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.46,1:17:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't say a word against my father！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.59,1:17:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Masters shall be reunited once more！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.63,1:17:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Severus.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.35,1:17:36.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，don't kill me！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.22,1:17:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,The prophecy did not refer to a woman.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.57,1:17:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,It spoke about a boy born at the end of the July.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.98,1:17:44.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，but he thinks it's her son！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.84,1:17:48.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,He intends to hunt them down and to kill them.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.69,1:17:53.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hide him… hide them all。I beg you！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.32,1:17:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,What would you give me in exchange，Severus？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.67,1:18:00.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Anything。- Harry…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.05,1:18:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry，you were so loved.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.93,1:18:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,So loved！Harry，mama loves you.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.03,1:18:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dadda loves you.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.36,1:18:13.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry，be safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.69,1:18:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Be strong。- Avada Kedavra！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.23,1:18:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,You said you would keep her safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.40,1:18:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lily and James…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.83,1:18:30.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,…put their faith in the wrong person，Severus.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.70,1:18:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Rather like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.38,1:18:36.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,The boy survives.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.99,1:18:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,He doesn't need protection，the Dark Lord has gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.31,1:18:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Dark Lord will return.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.52,1:18:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,And when he does，the boy will be in terrible danger！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.80,1:18:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,He has her eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.68,1:18:55.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you truly loved her…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.49,1:19:02.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,No one，can know.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.51,1:19:05.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,I shall never reveal the best of you，Severus.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.06,1:19:06.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your word？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.29,1:19:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can you risk your life every day to protect the boy？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.26,1:19:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,He possesses no measurable talent，his arrogance rivals even that of his father
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.26,1:19:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,and he seems to relish in his fame
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.72,1:19:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't say a word against my father！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.90,1:19:21.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,James Potter，lazy，arrogant.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.52,1:19:25.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- My father was a great man！- Your father was a swine！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.33,1:19:32.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Drink it，it will contain the curse to your hand，for the time being.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.85,1:19:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It will spread，Albus。- How a long？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.34,1:19:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe a year.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.92,1:19:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't ignore me，Severus.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.78,1:19:49.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,We both know Lord Voldemort has ordered the Malfoy boy to murder me.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.52,1:19:58.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,But should he fail，I should presume the Dark Lord will turn to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.22,1:20:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,You must be the one to kill me，Severus.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.46,1:20:07.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,It is the only way.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.52,1:20:12.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Only then，will the Dark Lord trust you completely.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.00,1:20:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,It will come a time，when Harry Potter，must be told something.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.55,1:20:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,But you must wait，until Voldemort is at his most vulnerable.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.59,1:20:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Must be told what？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.40,1:20:38.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,On the night，Lord Voldemort went to Godric's Hollow to kill Harry…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.42,1:20:42.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,And Lily Potter cast herself between them…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.74,1:20:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,…the curse rebounded.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.81,1:20:50.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,When that happens，a part of Voldemort's soul…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.80,1:20:55.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,…latched itself onto the only living thing it could find…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.22,1:20:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,…Harry himself.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.00,1:21:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's a reason Harry can speak with snakes…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.99,1:21:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's a reason he can look into Lord Voldemort's mind…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.20,1:21:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,A part of Voldemort lives inside him.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.79,1:21:23.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，when the time comes…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.68,1:21:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,…the boy must die？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.12,1:21:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes… yes。He must die.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.84,1:21:56.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,You've kept him alive，so he can die at the proper moment？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.78,1:22:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,You've been raising him like a pig for slaughter.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.14,1:22:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't tell me now，that you've grown to care for the boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.89,1:22:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Expecto Patronum
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.39,1:22:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lily！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.33,1:22:34.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,After all this time？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.21,1:22:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Always.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.68,1:22:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，when the time comes…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.00,1:22:50.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,…the boy must die？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.82,1:22:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.72,1:22:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,He must die。And Voldemort himself must do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.77,1:23:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,That is essential.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.91,1:24:08.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Where've you been？- I thought you went to the forest.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.65,1:24:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm going there now.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.19,1:24:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you mad？No…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.16,1:24:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can't give yourself up to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.11,1:24:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,What is it，Harry？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.39,1:24:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,What is it you know？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.16,1:24:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's a reason I can hear them.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.74,1:24:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Horcruxes.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.40,1:24:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think I've known for a while.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.16,1:24:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I think you have，too.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.52,1:24:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'll go with you。- No，kill the snake.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.19,1:24:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kill the snake，and then it's just him！
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.57,1:26:12.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm ready to die.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.74,1:26:55.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Resurrection Stone.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.87,1:27:29.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,You've been so brave，sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.37,1:27:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why are you here？All of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.08,1:27:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,We never left.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.96,1:27:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Does…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.59,1:27:54.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Does it hurt？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.61,1:27:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dying？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.65,1:28:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Quicker than falling asleep.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.77,1:28:06.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're nearly there，son.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.36,1:28:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.95,1:28:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,I never wanted any of you to die for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.78,1:28:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,And，Remus，your son？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.65,1:28:18.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Others will tell him what his mother and father died for.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.16,1:28:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,One day，he'll understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.24,1:28:36.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,You'll stay with me？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.44,1:28:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Until the end.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.92,1:28:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,And he won't be able to see you？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.19,1:28:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.01,1:28:48.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're here，you see.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.67,1:29:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stay close to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.05,1:29:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Always.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.05,1:29:27.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,No sign of him，My Lord.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.42,1:29:45.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,I thought he would come.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.68,1:30:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry，no！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.55,1:30:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What're yeh doin' here？- Quiet！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.90,1:30:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry Potter…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.81,1:30:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,…The Boy Who Lived…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.64,1:30:57.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,…come to die.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.03,1:31:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Avada Kedavra
Dialogue: 0,1:32:14.10,1:32:15.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can't help…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.37,1:32:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry，you wonderful boy…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.79,1:32:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,You brave，brave man！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.55,1:32:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let us walk.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:36.96,1:32:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Professor，what is that？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.94,1:32:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Something beyond either of our help.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.46,1:32:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,A part of Voldemort sent here to die.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.27,1:32:52.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,And exactly where are we？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.93,1:32:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was going to ask you that.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.63,1:32:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where would you say that we are？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:57.60,1:33:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，it looks like King's Cross station.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.86,1:33:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Only cleaner…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.67,1:33:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,…and without all the trains.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.10,1:33:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,King's Cross，is that right？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.22,1:33:14.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is，as they say，「your」 party.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.01,1:33:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I expect you now realize that you and Voldemort…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:18.74,1:33:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,…have been connected by something other than fate.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:21.85,1:33:25.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Since that night in Godric's Hollow，all those years ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:25.08,1:33:26.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,So it's true then，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.75,1:33:29.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,A part of him lives within me，doesn't it？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.41,1:33:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.84,1:33:35.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's been just destroyed many moments ago by none other than Voldemort himself.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.68,1:33:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,You，were the Horcrux he never meant to make，Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:54.70,1:33:58.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I have to go back，haven't I？- Oh，that's up to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.49,1:34:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I've a choice？- Oh，yes！
Dialogue: 0,1:34:02.43,1:34:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're in King's Cross，you say.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.26,1:34:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think if you so decide，you'll be able to board a train.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.43,1:34:13.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,And where would it take me？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:14.83,1:34:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,On.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:34.67,1:34:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Voldemort has the Elder Wand.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.79,1:34:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.96,1:34:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- And the snake's still alive？- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:44.40,1:34:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I've nothing to kill it with？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:47.22,1:34:51.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Help will always be given at Hogwarts，Harry.To those who ask for it.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.75,1:34:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've always pride of myself on my ability to turn a phrase.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.78,1:35:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Words are，in my not so humble opinion…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:00.65,1:35:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,…are most inexhaustible source of magic.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:05.07,1:35:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Capable of inflicting injury and remedies.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.33,1:35:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I would in this case…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.20,1:35:14.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,…amend my original statement to this：
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.26,1:35:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Help，will always be given at Hogwarts，To those who deserve it.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.62,1:35:32.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do not pity the dead，Harry…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.59,1:35:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pity the living.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.18,1:35:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,And above all…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:39.01,1:35:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,…all those who live without love.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.80,1:35:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Professor，my mother's Patronus…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:44.83,1:35:47.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,…was a doe，wasn't it？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.58,1:35:50.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,As the same as Professor Snape's.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.95,1:35:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's curious，don't you think？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:54.49,1:35:56.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Actually，if I think about it…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.37,1:35:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,…it doesn't seem curious at all！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.04,1:36:02.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll be going now，Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:03.76,1:36:05.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Professor？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:09.22,1:36:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is this all real？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:12.34,1:36:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Or is it just happening inside my head？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.42,1:36:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Of course it's happening inside your head，Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:18.27,1:36:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why should that mean，that it's not real？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.42,1:36:29.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Professor？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.24,1:36:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,What should I do？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.44,1:36:36.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Professor！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.80,1:36:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,My Lord，My Lord… Are you hurt？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:43.60,1:36:45.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't need your help.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.91,1:37:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,The boy… Is he dead？
Dialogue: 0,1:37:14.83,1:37:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is he alive？
Dialogue: 0,1:37:17.43,1:37:18.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Draco，is he alive？
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.03,1:37:47.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:14.61,1:39:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who is that？Hagrid's carrying？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:17.69,1:39:19.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Neville，who is it？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:20.17,1:39:21.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry Potter…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:23.82,1:39:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- …is dead！- No！No！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:26.80,1:39:28.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Silence！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:32.56,1:39:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stupid girl！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:36.03,1:39:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry Potter…is dead！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:39.20,1:39:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,From this day forth…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:42.15,1:39:45.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,…you'll put your faith in me.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:56.02,1:39:58.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry Potter is dead！
Dialogue: 0,1:40:03.29,1:40:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,And now it's the time to declare yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:08.28,1:40:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come forward and join us…or die！
Dialogue: 0,1:40:20.48,1:40:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Draco！
Dialogue: 0,1:40:26.89,1:40:27.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Draco.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.69,1:40:32.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Draco.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:36.35,1:40:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:50.41,1:40:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well done，Draco.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:53.53,1:40:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well done！
Dialogue: 0,1:41:18.03,1:41:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，I must say I'd hoped for better.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:25.16,1:41:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,And who might you be，young man？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:29.05,1:41:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Neville Longbottom.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.66,1:41:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，Neville，I'm sure we can find a place for you in our rank.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:40.66,1:41:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'd like to say something.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:48.81,1:41:53.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，Neville，I'm sure we'd all be fascinated to hear what you have to say.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:57.86,1:42:00.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Doesn't matter that Harry is gone。- Stand down，Neville！
Dialogue: 0,1:42:00.14,1:42:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,People die everyday！
Dialogue: 0,1:42:04.47,1:42:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Friends，family.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:10.63,1:42:12.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.74,1:42:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,We lost Harry tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:17.64,1:42:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's still with us.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:20.17,1:42:21.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,In here.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.02,1:42:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,So as Fred，Remus…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:28.56,1:42:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tonks…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:31.43,1:42:33.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,All of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:34.58,1:42:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,They didn't die in vain.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:42.03,1:42:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,But you will.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:43.67,1:42:44.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Because you're wrong！
Dialogue: 0,1:42:45.78,1:42:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry's heart did beat for us.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:47.81,1:42:49.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,For all of us！
Dialogue: 0,1:42:49.22,1:42:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's not over！
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.21,1:42:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Confringo
Dialogue: 0,1:43:06.22,1:43:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on！
Dialogue: 0,1:43:17.46,1:43:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,All remain into the castle.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:19.23,1:43:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,We have to kill the snake.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:20.66,1:43:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Use this！
Dialogue: 0,1:43:21.53,1:43:22.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Neville！
Dialogue: 0,1:46:16.48,1:46:19.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not my daughter，you bitch！
Dialogue: 0,1:46:52.47,1:46:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，you were right…
Dialogue: 0,1:46:55.54,1:46:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,…when you told Professor Snape that wand was failing you.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:57.76,1:46:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,It will always fail…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:01.03,1:47:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,I killed Snape！
Dialogue: 0,1:47:02.82,1:47:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,But what if the wand never belonged to Snape？
Dialogue: 0,1:47:04.90,1:47:07.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,What if its allegiance is always to someone else？
Dialogue: 0,1:47:08.07,1:47:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，come on，Tom…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:09.37,1:47:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's finish this the way we started.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:11.96,1:47:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Together！Die！
Dialogue: 0,1:50:59.00,1:51:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harry！
Dialogue: 0,1:52:00.67,1:52:03.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why didn't it work for him？The Elder Wand？
Dialogue: 0,1:52:05.46,1:52:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,It answered to somebody else.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:08.24,1:52:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,When he killed Snape，he thought the wand would become his.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:11.19,1:52:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,But the thing is…
Dialogue: 0,1:52:13.42,1:52:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,The wand never belonged to Snape.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:15.76,1:52:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was Draco，who disarmed Dumbledore that night in the Astronomy tower.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:20.35,1:52:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,From that moment on and the wand answered him，
Dialogue: 0,1:52:25.42,1:52:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Until，the other night when I disarmed Draco.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:30.07,1:52:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,At Malfoy Manor.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:31.77,1:52:33.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，that means…
Dialogue: 0,1:52:35.57,1:52:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's mine！
Dialogue: 0,1:52:39.39,1:52:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What should we do with it？- We？
Dialogue: 0,1:52:43.40,1:52:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just saying，that's the Elder Wand.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:45.39,1:52:47.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,The most powerful wand in the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:48.12,1:52:51.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,With that，he'd be invincible.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:14.90,1:55:16.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Together.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:55.29,1:55:56.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Bag？- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:57.27,1:55:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jumper？
Dialogue: 0,1:56:00.40,1:56:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm gonna miss you.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:02.85,1:56:04.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here they come.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:19.97,1:56:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad？
Dialogue: 0,1:56:21.49,1:56:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,What if I am put in Slytherin？
Dialogue: 0,1:56:26.34,1:56:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Albus Severus Potter。You were named after two Headmasters of Hogwarts.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:33.91,1:56:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,One of them was a Slytherin。And he was the bravest man I've ever known.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:41.08,1:56:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- But just say if I am… - Then Slytherin house…
Dialogue: 0,1:56:44.09,1:56:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,…will have gained a wonderful young wizard.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:48.60,1:56:49.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,But listen…
Dialogue: 0,1:56:49.99,1:56:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,If it really means that much to you，you can choose Gryffindor.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:54.25,1:56:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Sorting Hat takes your choice into account.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:57.29,1:56:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Really？- Really.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:03.87,1:57:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Ready？- Ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.00,0:01:49.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,《哈利波特与死亡圣器（下）》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.55,0:02:01.32,Note,0,0,0,0,,（多比长眠于此 一个自由的精灵）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.53,0:02:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿真美
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.38,0:02:40.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,是姨妈的房子，小时候我们常来玩
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.06,0:02:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是凤凰社的藏身地
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.11,0:02:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,总算还有个住处
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.48,0:02:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻瓜认为风铃能辟邪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.84,0:02:53.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实没用的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.92,0:02:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要跟妖精谈谈
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.87,0:03:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,您怎么样了？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.16,0:03:14.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,还活着
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.81,0:03:20.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,您可能已经不记得…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.77,0:03:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得你第一次来古灵阁时，就是我带你去的金库？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.68,0:03:28.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使在妖精界你也相当有名，哈利·波特
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.06,0:03:34.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你安葬了那只精灵？ - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.47,0:03:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,还救我到这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.17,0:03:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.70,0:03:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,与众不同啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.27,0:03:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么得到宝剑的？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.14,0:04:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,说来话长
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.68,0:04:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝拉特里克斯·莱斯特兰奇的金库里有什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.67,0:04:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,说来话长
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.93,0:04:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝剑是自己出现的，在我们需要的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.76,0:04:18.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没偷
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.25,0:04:24.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱斯特兰奇夫人的金库里有把一模一样的宝剑
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.92,0:04:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那把是假的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.40,0:04:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏天时被人调包了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.69,0:04:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,而她从没怀疑过那是假的？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.48,0:04:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为它仿得十分逼真
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.83,0:04:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有妖精才能看出来这把才是真的格兰芬多宝剑
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.92,0:04:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁调的包？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.86,0:04:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍格沃茨的一位教授
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.18,0:04:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,就我所知他现在是校长
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.14,0:04:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯内普
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.22,0:04:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果莱斯特兰奇金库里的是赝品…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.88,0:04:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.20,0:04:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,古灵阁金库里的秘密可不止一两个
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.35,0:04:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱斯特兰奇夫人的金库里也有秘密么？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.02,0:05:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.71,0:05:08.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要进入古灵阁，进一个金库
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.94,0:05:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 绝无可能 - 我自己确实不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.81,0:05:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是有你在，就可能
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.91,0:05:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我为什么要帮你？ - 我有金币
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.60,0:05:23.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多很多金币
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.80,0:05:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对金币不感兴趣
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.62,0:05:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你要什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.05,0:05:33.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.99,0:05:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是我的开价
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.37,0:05:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得贝拉特里克斯的金库里有魂器？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.08,0:05:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,她以为我们去过金库，都吓疯了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.45,0:05:56.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不停问我，还拿了什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.45,0:05:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我敢肯定那里有魂器，有他灵魂的一部分
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.83,0:06:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去找，销毁魂器，就离杀死他更近了一步
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.27,0:06:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是如果你把宝剑给了拉环
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.41,0:06:07.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们找到魂器后要怎么销毁啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.56,0:06:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这我还没想好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.92,0:06:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很虚弱
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.84,0:06:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.64,0:06:28.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥利凡德先生…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.95,0:06:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有些问题需要问你
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.14,0:06:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以，孩子，在所不辞
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.10,0:06:39.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,能帮我鉴定下这根魔杖吗？ 我想知道用它安不安全
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.98,0:06:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯…胡桃木
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.97,0:06:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,龙心弦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.08,0:06:55.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,12.75英寸
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.82,0:06:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不易…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.74,0:07:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不易弯曲
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.60,0:07:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这根魔杖属于贝拉特里克斯·莱斯特兰奇
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.03,0:07:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心使用
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.57,0:07:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这根呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.35,0:07:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,山楂木
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.38,0:07:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,独角兽毛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.15,0:07:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,10英寸
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.35,0:07:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,弹性适中
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.22,0:07:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这曾是德拉科·马尔福的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.69,0:07:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾是？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.10,0:07:37.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道现在不是了？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.28,0:07:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能不是了，如果被你夺到的话
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.88,0:07:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能感到它已改变了效忠对象
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.88,0:07:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,您把魔杖说得好像有感情一样…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.00,0:08:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,还能思考
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.65,0:08:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔杖选择巫师，波特先生
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.61,0:08:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这对我们研究魔杖学问的人来说，一直很明确
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.38,0:08:18.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,那您知道死亡圣器么？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.27,0:08:25.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,传说有三件圣器
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.51,0:08:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,老魔杖、能让你躲避敌人的隐形衣
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.18,0:08:41.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有复活石，能让你爱的人起死回生
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.12,0:08:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,同时拥有三件圣器，你就是死亡的主人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.75,0:08:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是，没几个人相信这种东西真的存在
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.76,0:08:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,您呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.02,0:08:57.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,您相信它们存在吗，先生？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.99,0:09:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.53,0:09:07.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得没必要相信这老掉牙的传说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.68,0:09:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在撒谎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.21,0:09:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道有一件存在
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.66,0:09:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你告诉了他，你告诉了他老魔杖的事…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.30,0:09:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有去哪儿能找到它
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.76,0:09:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他拷问我
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.41,0:09:30.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.44,0:09:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是告诉了他传说
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.67,0:09:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,传说…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.57,0:09:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,传说并没有讲怎样能找到老魔杖
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.64,0:09:47.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他已经找到了，先生
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.31,0:09:55.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,您好好休息吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.83,0:10:00.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在找你，波特先生
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.66,0:10:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你说的是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.71,0:10:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他找到了老魔杖
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.55,0:10:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.75,0:10:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就真的没希望赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.91,0:10:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我就在他找到我之前杀了他
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.69,0:10:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定这是她的？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.48,0:10:28.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.03,0:10:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎样？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.78,0:10:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.99,0:10:41.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吓人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.40,0:10:45.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以让赫敏拿着剑吗，拉环？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.45,0:11:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就靠你了，拉环
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.88,0:11:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你能带我们穿过金库的守卫…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.00,0:11:10.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝剑就归你
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.00,0:11:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱斯特兰奇夫人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.95,0:11:26.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.77,0:11:31.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好？早上好？！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.77,0:11:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是贝拉特里克斯·莱斯特兰奇，不是小学生！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.96,0:11:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！冷静点！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.50,0:11:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是她漏了马脚，我们就只能用宝剑来自刎了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.59,0:11:42.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.82,0:11:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说的对
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.16,0:11:46.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚才傻死了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.53,0:11:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，我们走
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.27,0:12:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去我的金库
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.49,0:13:03.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,有身份证明么？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.94,0:13:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看没那个必要吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.98,0:13:13.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱斯特兰奇夫人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.02,0:13:21.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不想等太久
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.86,0:13:23.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们知道了…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.57,0:13:25.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们知道她是冒充的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.66,0:13:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们一定得到了警告
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.34,0:13:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.67,0:13:42.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么办啊，哈利？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.18,0:13:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱斯特兰奇夫人，可否请您出示下您的魔杖？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.73,0:13:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.64,0:13:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是银行规定，请您务必谅解 现在形势特殊嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.36,0:14:03.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，我一点都不理解！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.46,0:14:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉，我必须要看
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.84,0:14:14.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,魂魄出窍！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.04,0:14:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，莱斯特兰奇夫人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.60,0:14:24.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,请跟我来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.65,0:15:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么，拉环？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.63,0:15:07.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉环？！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.85,0:15:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,减震咒！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.29,0:15:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得好，赫敏
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.06,0:15:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,遭了！你们俩又变回原样了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.67,0:15:49.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,防贼瀑布会冲掉所有魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.57,0:15:50.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,会很危险
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.85,0:15:52.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们出去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.79,0:15:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺便问下，这还有别的出路吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.86,0:15:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,没了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.76,0:16:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有何企图，为什么来这？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.43,0:16:03.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,小偷！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.10,0:16:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不想再…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.72,0:16:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 魂魄出窍！- 你！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.25,0:16:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,听上去不妙啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.53,0:16:30.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.13,0:16:32.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙怎么病怏怏的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.88,0:16:33.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.07,0:16:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,它受过训练，听到这个声音就会想到疼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.77,0:16:49.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,真残忍！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.66,0:17:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,荧光闪烁
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.65,0:17:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么多
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.65,0:17:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,魂器飞来！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.15,0:17:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想在这试飞来咒啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.50,0:17:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那种魔法在古灵阁里没用的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.37,0:17:48.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这儿吗，哈利？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.13,0:17:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能感觉到吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.29,0:18:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了！在那上边！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.36,0:18:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在这施了复制咒，被碰到的东西都会自我复制
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.04,0:18:24.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,把剑给我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.29,0:18:43.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.69,0:19:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住它！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.53,0:19:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们说好的，拉环！ - 拿剑来换金杯！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.65,0:19:23.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我答应带你进来，可我没答应过带你出去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.19,0:19:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉环！求你别走！拉环！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.60,0:19:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.67,0:19:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是没有丁当片…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.48,0:19:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是鲍格罗德
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.04,0:20:05.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是不幸
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.63,0:20:11.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能傻站在这，快想办法！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.15,0:20:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是最聪明的么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.63,0:20:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个主意，但是很疯狂！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.34,0:20:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,粉身碎骨！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.19,0:20:32.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,快上来啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.33,0:20:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,力松劲泄！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.91,0:21:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.08,0:21:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.39,0:21:53.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,粉身碎骨！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.30,0:21:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓紧！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.95,0:22:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,太厉害了！有才！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.39,0:22:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,下降了！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.02,0:22:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们跳吧！ - 什么时候？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.51,0:22:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.40,0:23:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.74,0:23:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,“神秘人”
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.48,0:23:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道我们闯进了古灵阁
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.16,0:23:47.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道我们拿了什么，他也知道我们在找魂器
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.61,0:23:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他怎么知道的？ - 我让他知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.44,0:23:53.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让他进入了你的思想？ 哈利，你不能这么做！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.22,0:23:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫敏，我有时控制不住！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.43,0:23:56.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许能吧，我也不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.03,0:23:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,别争这个了，你看到了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.41,0:24:00.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很愤怒…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.61,0:24:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,也很惊恐
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.14,0:24:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他明白，如果我们毁了所有的魂器，就能杀了他
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.96,0:24:08.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会不惜一切代价阻止我们找到其他魂器
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.04,0:24:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一个魂器
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.88,0:24:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在霍格沃茨
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.27,0:24:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.39,0:24:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看见了？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.11,0:24:17.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到了霍格沃茨城堡
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.18,0:24:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有罗伊纳·拉文克劳
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.33,0:24:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是跟她有关
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.65,0:24:20.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须去学校，现在就去！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.79,0:24:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能现在动身！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.00,0:24:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得制定计划，得好好想清楚！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.66,0:24:27.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫敏，我们哪次计划顺利进行过？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.36,0:24:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我们计划好了再去，就太迟了！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.07,0:24:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说得对！但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.14,0:24:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯内普现在是校长，我们不能走正门啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.51,0:24:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那…我们去霍格莫德
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.67,0:24:42.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,去蜂蜜公爵
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.07,0:24:43.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,走地窖里的密道
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.82,0:24:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.82,0:24:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有些不对劲
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.19,0:24:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,就好像，以前…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.67,0:24:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我总能看到他的思想
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.36,0:24:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在都是杂乱无章的片段
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.84,0:24:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是因为魂器被毁，也许他正渐渐虚弱
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.07,0:24:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他快死了！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.14,0:24:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.01,0:25:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,更像是受了伤
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.79,0:25:04.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以肯定一点，他比以往更危险了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.50,0:25:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在这儿，快点！ - 仔细搜查
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.77,0:25:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.00,0:26:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,快！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.98,0:26:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,到这来，波特
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.24,0:26:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看见他了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.90,0:26:50.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我差点以为是… - 我懂，像邓布利多
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.44,0:27:08.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.05,0:27:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能从这里看见你
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.93,0:27:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们几个笨蛋，来这干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.12,0:27:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道这有多危险吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.78,0:27:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是阿不福思，邓布利多的弟弟
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.03,0:27:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在镜子里看到的就是你
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.64,0:27:40.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你派多比救我的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.38,0:27:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他怎么没跟你们一起？ - 他死了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.05,0:27:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是可惜，我喜欢那只小精灵
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.13,0:27:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁给你的？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.49,0:27:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那面镜子？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.56,0:27:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,蒙顿格斯·弗莱奇，约一年前
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.20,0:27:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,蒙顿格斯没权给你，它属于…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.82,0:27:54.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,小天狼星…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.85,0:27:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿不思告诉我了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.32,0:28:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还说要是你发现了镜子在我这
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.00,0:28:04.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定会生气的，不过你扪心自问
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.12,0:28:06.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是不在我这你会怎样？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.80,0:28:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,有其他凤凰社成员的消息么？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.30,0:28:14.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,凤凰社完了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.75,0:28:16.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,“神秘人”已经赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.22,0:28:20.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁敢不这么说就是自寻死路
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.93,0:28:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要进入霍格沃茨，就今晚
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.86,0:28:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,邓布利多给了我们一项任务
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.72,0:28:26.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.64,0:28:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,轻松愉快的好任务么？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.70,0:28:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在找魂器
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.25,0:28:35.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们认为最后一件就在城堡里
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.39,0:28:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,但需要你的帮助才能进去
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.49,0:28:40.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我哥给的这哪是什么任务啊，简直是自杀行动
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.68,0:28:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托，孩子，回家去吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.27,0:28:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,还能多活几天
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.18,0:28:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,邓布利多相信我能完成任务
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.79,0:28:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道你能相信他？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.32,0:28:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道我哥跟你说的话都可信？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.84,0:28:53.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认识他这么久
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.54,0:28:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可曾提起过我？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.95,0:28:58.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,可曾提起过她？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.94,0:29:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他干嘛要… - 要保密？你说呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.63,0:29:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我信任他 - 这答案太幼稚了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.39,0:29:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,邓布利多连从何找起都没告诉你 你就为他的片面之词搜集魂器？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.33,0:29:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你骗人！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.02,0:29:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你骗我不要紧，但你在骗你自己
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.06,0:29:19.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是愚蠢之举
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.34,0:29:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看你不像是蠢人啊，哈利·波特！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.82,0:29:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再问一遍，是什么原因
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.79,0:29:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对你们兄弟间的恩怨不感兴趣
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.99,0:29:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不在乎你已经放弃战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.61,0:29:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我信任邓布利多
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.32,0:29:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们今晚要进入霍格沃茨
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.92,0:29:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道该做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.41,0:30:04.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让她去哪儿了？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.75,0:30:05.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.45,0:30:08.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.97,0:30:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是你妹妹，阿利安娜，是吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.50,0:30:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,她很年轻就过世了，是么？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.33,0:30:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我哥为了追求力量牺牲了许多东西，波特先生
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.32,0:30:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括阿利安娜
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.52,0:30:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,她很崇拜他
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.90,0:30:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他给了她一切
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.40,0:30:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,却没给她时间
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.49,0:30:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢您，邓布利多先生
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.83,0:30:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他救了我们两次
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.88,0:30:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,还通过镜子关注我们
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.42,0:30:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不像是要放弃战斗的人
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.12,0:31:07.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,她回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.53,0:31:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,她后边是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.43,0:31:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳威！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.53,0:31:20.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么这么… - 狼狈，我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.65,0:31:22.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.98,0:31:24.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,西莫比我还惨
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.02,0:31:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，阿不！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.14,0:31:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还有几个人要过来
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.42,0:31:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不记得地图上有这条道啊
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.43,0:31:33.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为是新开通的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.25,0:31:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来7条密道开学前就被封了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.14,0:31:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在只有这一条路可以进出
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.77,0:31:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,到处都是食死徒和摄魂怪
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.00,0:31:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯内普校长当得怎么样啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.78,0:31:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都没见过他
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.87,0:31:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直是卡罗兄妹在监视学生
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.04,0:31:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡罗兄妹？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.99,0:31:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊，管纪律的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.59,0:31:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们喜欢体罚
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.24,0:31:53.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们把你弄这样的？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.98,0:31:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.84,0:31:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天黑魔法防御术课要练钻心咒
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.03,0:31:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,对一年级新生用
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.64,0:32:02.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不愿意
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.52,0:32:04.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍格沃茨已经变了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.24,0:32:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,来开心一下吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.81,0:32:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，看我带什么来了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.84,0:32:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,有惊喜喔
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.34,0:32:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,但愿不是阿不福思做的饭
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.66,0:32:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还能消化它就已经是惊喜了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.90,0:32:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 噢，天呐！ - 哈利！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.25,0:32:54.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,去告诉卢平他们，哈利回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.42,0:32:56.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦，好啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.65,0:32:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用等“神秘人”，他就先被我们抱死了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.09,0:33:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,…收到了吗？最新天气预报，闪电已划破长空
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.22,0:33:02.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,重复，闪电已划破长空
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.81,0:33:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么计划，哈利？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.23,0:33:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.34,0:33:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要找一样东西
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.79,0:33:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一样东西就藏在城堡里
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.12,0:33:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能会有助于我们打败“神秘人”
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.84,0:33:22.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧，什么东西？ - 不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.92,0:33:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它在哪儿？ - 也不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.26,0:33:29.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道的信息不多
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.56,0:33:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本就没有信息
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.48,0:33:33.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得它跟拉文克劳有关
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.16,0:33:38.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该很小巧，易于藏匿
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.74,0:33:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人想到什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.43,0:33:45.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,是罗伊纳·拉文克劳的丢失的冠冕
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.70,0:33:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊，又开始了！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.61,0:33:50.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉文克劳丢失的冠冕？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.28,0:33:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人听说过吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.33,0:33:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,很有名的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.84,0:33:56.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说过，但是卢娜，冠冕已经丢了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.83,0:34:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,丢了几百年了，没有活人见过它
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.42,0:34:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思，谁能告诉我冠冕是什么鬼东西？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.86,0:34:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一个皇冠
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.04,0:34:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,像头饰那样的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.77,0:34:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.22,0:34:13.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨，你好
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.06,0:34:19.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,6个月没见她就像不认识我似的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.92,0:34:20.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可是她哥啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.19,0:34:23.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哥哥有很多，可哈利只有一个 - 闭嘴，西莫！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.42,0:34:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了，金妮？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.19,0:34:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯内普发现了…他发现哈利去霍格莫德了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.34,0:35:14.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们一定很纳闷，我为什么大半夜叫你们集合
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.54,0:35:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚早些时候，我发现…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.68,0:35:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利·波特出现在霍格莫德
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.42,0:35:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.18,0:35:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是有人…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.46,0:35:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不论是学生还是教员，胆敢协助波特先生
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.97,0:35:47.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,都将受到与其行为同等严重的惩罚，不仅如此
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.36,0:35:52.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是有人知道什么情况…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.40,0:35:57.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,却隐瞒不报…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.32,0:36:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,也将受到严惩
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.04,0:36:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.35,0:36:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是有人知道波特先生今晚的行动
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.35,0:36:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我建议你最好站出来
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.58,0:36:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,就现在
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.83,0:36:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来您貌似滴水不漏的防御措施…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.96,0:36:56.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是有安全隐患啊，校长…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.43,0:37:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,隐患还不小呢
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.96,0:37:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么还有脸站在他的位置上？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.64,0:37:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉大家那晚发生了什么！告诉大家你是怎样看着他的眼睛…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.73,0:37:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他那么信任你，你却杀了他
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.34,0:37:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,说啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.46,0:37:54.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.52,0:37:56.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,波特？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.76,0:38:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你们很多人都想反抗
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.17,0:38:41.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至有人还以为反抗是明智的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.72,0:38:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是愚蠢
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.52,0:38:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,交出哈利·波特
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.48,0:38:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,交出他，大家就相安无事
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.67,0:38:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,交出哈利·波特，我保证霍格沃茨不受损害
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.16,0:39:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,交出哈利·波特，我会给你们奖赏
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.03,0:39:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有1小时时间
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.38,0:39:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,还等什么？快抓住他！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.39,0:39:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,学生下床了！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.90,0:39:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 学生都跑到走廊里了！ - 他们应该下床
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.15,0:39:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这啰嗦的白痴！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.18,0:39:47.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉，夫人
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.80,0:39:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然你来了，费尔奇先生…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.27,0:39:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,来得正好
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.81,0:39:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果可以的话，我想请你把帕金森小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.81,0:39:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,和斯莱特林学院的其他同学，都带走
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.51,0:40:01.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,带他们去哪儿啊，夫人？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.40,0:40:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,地牢
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.78,0:40:11.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定是有事才回来的，波特
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.60,0:40:12.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.41,0:40:15.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间，教授，越多越好
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.50,0:40:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,做你应做的事去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.08,0:40:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来守护城堡
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.49,0:40:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,波特…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.99,0:40:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.72,0:40:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你，教授
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.04,0:40:31.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,守住城堡
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.87,0:40:44.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.71,0:40:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟赫敏刚才在想，就算我们找到了所有魂器也没用
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.81,0:40:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.77,0:40:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你能毁了它
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.21,0:40:51.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们就想到…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.66,0:40:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是罗恩想到的，是罗恩的主意
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.04,0:40:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他真是太聪明了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.34,0:40:56.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是用蛇怪的牙毁了汤姆·里德尔的日记吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.04,0:41:00.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和赫敏可以去找毒牙
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.28,0:41:01.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.87,0:41:03.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧，带着这个
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.17,0:41:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样你们回来时就能找到我了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.00,0:41:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.53,0:41:09.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉文克劳的公共休息室，先找找看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.83,0:41:18.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利！哈利！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.36,0:41:20.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得问清楚了，教授
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.90,0:41:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,您真允许我们这么做？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.74,0:41:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错，隆巴顿
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.10,0:41:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可是爆炸啊！爆炸！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.84,0:41:27.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.14,0:41:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.75,0:41:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要怎么炸啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.33,0:41:34.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以去请教斐尼甘先生啊
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.30,0:41:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得他对引爆可是相当有天赋
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.46,0:41:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能炸了它
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.72,0:41:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才像话，快去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.04,0:41:46.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的，我们阻挡不了“神秘人”太长时间的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.33,0:41:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以拖住他
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.41,0:41:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有，他的名字是伏地魔 菲利乌斯，你也应该这样叫他
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.22,0:41:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正他都要来杀你
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.32,0:42:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,石墩出动！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.71,0:42:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍格沃茨危在旦夕
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.12,0:42:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,守卫边界，保护师生，为我学校，尽职尽责！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.24,0:42:33.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想用这个咒语很久了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.26,0:42:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,超强盔甲护身，统统护卫
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.68,0:42:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,超强盔甲护身，统统护卫
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.38,0:42:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,超强盔甲护身，统统护卫
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.50,0:43:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利，等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.88,0:43:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有话要说！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.64,0:43:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我有点忙，卢娜 - 你不知道要去哪儿找
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.02,0:43:32.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在浪费时间！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.56,0:43:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,一会儿再说吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.51,0:43:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哈利？ - 再说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.64,0:43:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利·波特，你现在就给我听着！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.24,0:43:43.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还记得秋是怎么说拉文克劳冠冕的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.20,0:43:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有活人见过它
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.01,0:43:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.29,0:43:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得去问死人
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.78,0:44:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,好壮观啊
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.39,0:44:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,要找她的话，她就在那里面
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.83,0:44:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不一跟我去？ - 不了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.41,0:44:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得最好让你俩单独谈
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.64,0:44:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,她很害羞的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.26,0:44:57.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是格雷女士
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.22,0:44:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉文克劳塔楼的幽灵
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.72,0:45:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不叫那个名字！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.00,0:45:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起，对不起！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.86,0:45:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,是海莲娜
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.17,0:45:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,海莲娜·拉文克劳，罗伊纳的女儿
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.39,0:45:11.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是卢娜的朋友？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.11,0:45:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.04,0:45:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说你能帮我
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.81,0:45:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要找我母亲的冠冕？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.44,0:45:23.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.84,0:45:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.16,0:45:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢娜很善良
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.84,0:45:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不像大多数人
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.23,0:45:35.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她错了，我不能帮你！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.00,0:45:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你，别走！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.54,0:45:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要销毁它！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.52,0:46:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是没有长进
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.43,0:46:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,真遗憾
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.81,0:46:32.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,主人…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.37,0:46:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不再等等吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.72,0:46:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,进攻！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.56,0:47:09.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也想这样不是吗，海莲娜？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.50,0:47:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也想毁了它
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.25,0:47:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,许多年前有一个人也承诺会毁了它
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.61,0:47:20.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个奇怪的男孩，名字也很怪
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.11,0:47:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤姆·里德尔
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.55,0:47:22.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他骗了我
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.49,0:47:24.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他骗过许多人
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.65,0:47:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道他干了什么！我知道他是谁！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.96,0:47:31.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他用黑魔法玷污了冠冕！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.97,0:47:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能毁了它
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.34,0:47:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,彻底销毁
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.76,0:47:54.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你得先告诉我他把冠冕藏哪儿了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.74,0:47:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定知道他藏哪儿了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.63,0:48:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吗，海莲娜？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.07,0:48:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.85,0:48:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.21,0:48:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.43,0:48:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你有点像他
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.93,0:48:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,冠冕就在城堡里
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.15,0:48:36.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,在一个能藏下所有东西的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.29,0:48:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你还要问…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.57,0:48:42.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你永远也不会知道
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.06,0:48:45.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你知道…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.46,0:48:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只需开口问
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.98,0:48:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.62,0:49:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉麦格教授，我和莱姆斯负责城堡这边
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.63,0:49:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,是，先生！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.05,0:49:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃迪，还是告诉麦格教授
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.05,0:49:19.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边再需要几个帮手吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.07,0:49:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,决定成败的是人信念的强弱
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.07,0:49:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是帮手的多少
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.74,0:49:29.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁说的？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.93,0:49:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.90,0:49:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗，弗雷德？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.27,0:49:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.42,0:49:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.13,0:50:01.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利做梦时说的
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.85,0:50:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.84,0:50:06.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么会知道
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.09,0:50:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,来呀！就凭你们？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.33,0:51:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.04,0:51:20.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不行 - 你行！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.21,0:54:21.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳威！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.21,0:54:39.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切顺利
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.95,0:55:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,快进去！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.85,0:55:56.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,金妮！纳威！你们还好吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.98,0:55:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,再好不过了！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.20,0:55:59.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得自己战火熊熊！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.21,0:56:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢娜在上边吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.52,0:56:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢娜？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.89,0:56:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢她！我现在就得告诉她
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.81,0:56:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然天亮前我们可能都没命了！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.58,0:56:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我懂的
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.71,0:56:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死！这可怎么找他啊
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.45,0:56:45.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在这儿！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.21,0:56:46.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他刚刚… - 厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.21,0:56:48.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他刚刚消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.71,0:56:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我敢肯定我看见了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.54,0:56:55.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可能去了有求必应屋
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.51,0:56:56.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,地图上无法显示有求必应屋
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.98,0:56:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去年说的
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.55,0:57:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错，是我说的
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.81,0:57:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.26,0:57:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,有才
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.37,0:57:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,走！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.16,0:59:06.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.63,0:59:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来这儿干什么，波特？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.35,0:59:11.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正想问你
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.83,0:59:14.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拿了我的魔杖
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.92,0:59:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要夺回来
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.08,0:59:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在这根怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.57,0:59:19.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我母亲的
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.02,0:59:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,很强，但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.11,0:59:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.21,0:59:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,用着不顺手
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.43,0:59:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白我意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.04,0:59:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么没告诉她？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.86,0:59:35.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉贝拉特里克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.48,0:59:39.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明知那就是我
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.74,0:59:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,却什么都没说
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.05,0:59:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,动手吧，德拉科！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.73,0:59:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,别傻站着了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.52,0:59:47.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,动手！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.87,0:59:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.30,0:59:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,除你武器！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.86,0:59:54.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿瓦达索命！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.23,0:59:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,昏昏倒地！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.67,1:00:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,敢动我女朋友，你们死定了！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.09,1:00:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.83,1:00:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑！他们把这鬼地方给点了！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.81,1:01:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,快！这边！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.37,1:02:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能丢下他们！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.81,1:02:02.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他开玩笑呢吧？！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.52,1:02:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我们被他们拖死了我就杀了你！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.32,1:02:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.18,1:03:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,主人？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.81,1:03:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿瓦达索命！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.78,1:03:40.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来，纳吉尼，我得保证你的安全
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.03,1:03:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是那条蛇
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.26,1:03:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后一件
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.67,1:03:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是最后一件魂器
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.03,1:04:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,进入他的思想，哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.01,1:04:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看他在哪儿，找到他就能找到蛇
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.22,1:04:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就毁掉所有魂器了！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.19,1:04:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,主人…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.73,1:04:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许…呃…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.97,1:04:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是建议停止大范围进攻
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.79,1:04:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,您亲自去找那个男孩儿
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.09,1:04:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不需要找他
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.88,1:05:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不出今晚，他自会找上门！ 听懂了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.35,1:05:06.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.87,1:05:10.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么还有脸说？卢修斯！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.92,1:05:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.74,1:05:17.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,去找西弗勒斯
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.98,1:05:20.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,带他来见我
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.39,1:05:30.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道他在哪儿了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.51,1:05:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,快上！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.82,1:06:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.14,1:07:21.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,仅这几个小时，您就用这根魔杖施展了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.26,1:07:23.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,高超的魔法，主人
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.23,1:07:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.76,1:07:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对！高超的是我，而魔杖一直在反抗
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.17,1:07:39.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有魔杖比这根更强 奥利凡德也是这么说的
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.21,1:07:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚，等找到了那个男孩儿 魔杖不会让您失望的，我敢保证…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.38,1:07:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔杖听从您，只听从您一人
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.30,1:07:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.63,1:08:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,主人
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.33,1:08:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔杖真的听从于我吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.45,1:08:10.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个聪明人，西弗勒斯
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.74,1:08:12.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定知道…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.84,1:08:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 魔杖到底效忠于谁？ - 效忠您…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.82,1:08:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然是您，主人
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.21,1:08:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,老魔杖没有好好为我效力 因为我不是它真正的主人
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.26,1:08:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,老魔杖属于杀死它前任主人的巫师
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.65,1:08:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你杀了邓布利多，西弗勒斯
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.12,1:08:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你活着，老魔杖就不可能真正属于我
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.90,1:08:58.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直是个忠心耿耿的好仆人，西弗勒斯
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.09,1:09:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,但只有我…才能永生
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.15,1:09:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,主人…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.84,1:09:16.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳吉尼，杀！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.31,1:10:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这…拿去…求你…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.72,1:10:28.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我个容器！快点，瓶子之类的！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.41,1:10:49.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,放到冥想盆里
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.97,1:10:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.07,1:11:01.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,眼睛跟你妈妈一样…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.47,1:11:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的抵抗很英勇，但都是徒劳的…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.91,1:11:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不希望发生这样的事 每一滴巫师的血都是严重的损失
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.56,1:11:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此，我会下令撤军…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.37,1:12:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后，你们可以体面地安置死者
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.97,1:12:12.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利·波特，现在我直接对你说
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.66,1:12:20.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚，你居然听任朋友为你而死 而不愿亲自来面对我
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.03,1:12:27.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是太可耻了 来禁林找我…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.36,1:12:29.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,面对自己的命运
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.93,1:12:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不来，我会杀光所有试图窝藏你的人.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.93,1:12:44.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不论男女老幼
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.32,1:13:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都哪儿去了？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.11,1:13:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.18,1:13:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托，别这样
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.34,1:13:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,她去了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.83,1:13:46.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，她走了…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.55,1:16:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪胎！别跑！我要告诉妈妈！你是怪胎！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.93,1:16:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怪胎，莉莉！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.86,1:16:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.82,1:16:29.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,她嫉妒你，她只是凡人 而你却与众不同
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.86,1:16:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这么说，西弗勒斯
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.45,1:16:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,格兰芬多！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.29,1:17:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好，我是詹姆 - 你好，我是莉莉
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.34,1:17:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你爹一样，懒惰、傲慢
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.46,1:17:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许说我父亲坏话！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.59,1:17:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,无辜者的鲜血将流淌，主仆将再度联手！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.63,1:17:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,西弗勒斯
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.35,1:17:36.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,别杀我！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.22,1:17:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,预言没说是女人
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.57,1:17:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,说的是一个七月底出生的男孩儿
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.98,1:17:44.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,是，他认为是莉莉的儿子！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.84,1:17:48.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要找到他们一家，然后杀光
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.69,1:17:53.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他们藏起来，都藏起来，我求你了！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.32,1:17:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拿什么跟我交换，西弗勒斯？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.67,1:18:00.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么都行 - 哈利…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.05,1:18:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利，我们好爱你
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.93,1:18:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常爱！哈利，妈妈爱你
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.03,1:18:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸也爱你
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.36,1:18:13.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利要活下去
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.69,1:18:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要坚强！ - 阿瓦达索命！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.23,1:18:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说过…你说过的…你会保证她的安全！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.40,1:18:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉莉和詹姆…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.83,1:18:30.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们信错了人，西弗勒斯
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.70,1:18:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不也是么
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.38,1:18:36.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,她儿子还活着
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.99,1:18:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不需要保护，黑魔王已经死了！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.31,1:18:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑魔王还会回来的！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.52,1:18:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,到时那孩子就会有危险！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.80,1:18:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他眼睛和他妈妈一样
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.68,1:18:55.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你真的爱她…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.49,1:19:02.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许告诉任何人
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.51,1:19:05.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是要我永不透露你善良的一面？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.06,1:19:06.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你保证？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.29,1:19:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能每天都冒生命危险保护这孩子吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.26,1:19:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他天资平庸，跟他爹一样傲慢无礼
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.26,1:19:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点名气就沾沾自喜
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.72,1:19:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许说我父亲坏话！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.90,1:19:21.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆·波特，懒惰、傲慢
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.52,1:19:25.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我父亲是个伟大的人！ - 你父亲是个卑鄙小人！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.33,1:19:32.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝了，它能把魔咒封在手部，但只是暂时的
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.85,1:19:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迟早会扩散 - 我还有多少时间？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.34,1:19:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概一年
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.92,1:19:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,别走，西弗勒斯
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.78,1:19:49.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你我都知道伏地魔王已经派马尔福来杀我
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.52,1:19:58.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他失败了，我想伏地魔定会让你动手
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.22,1:20:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须由你杀死我，西弗勒斯
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.46,1:20:07.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有这一个办法
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.52,1:20:12.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有这样，伏地魔才会完全信任你
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.00,1:20:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,等时机成熟，你一定要告诉哈利·波特一件事
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.55,1:20:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,但一定要等到伏地魔最虚弱的时刻
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.59,1:20:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.40,1:20:38.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,伏地魔去戈德里克山谷要杀哈利的那个晚上…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.42,1:20:42.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉莉·波特用自己的身体挡在他们之间时…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.74,1:20:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔咒反弹了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.81,1:20:50.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时，伏地魔灵魂的一个碎片…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.80,1:20:55.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,附着在了屋里唯一的活物身上…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.22,1:20:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,在哈利体内
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.00,1:21:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利会蛇佬腔…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.99,1:21:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,能连接伏地魔的思想，都是有原因的
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.20,1:21:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,伏地魔的一部分就活在他体内
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.79,1:21:23.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是说，到时候…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.68,1:21:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那男孩儿就必须死？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.12,1:21:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的…他必须死
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.84,1:21:56.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让他活着，就为了让他在适当的时候再死？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.78,1:22:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你养着他就像养一头待宰的猪
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.14,1:22:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,可别跟我说，你对他产生感情了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.89,1:22:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼神护卫！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.39,1:22:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉莉！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.33,1:22:34.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么久了你还是…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.21,1:22:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直都是
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.68,1:22:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么，到时候…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.00,1:22:50.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那男孩儿就必须死？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.82,1:22:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.72,1:22:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他必须死，而且必须由伏地魔动手
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.77,1:23:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才是关键
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.91,1:24:08.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你去哪儿了？ - 我还以为你去了禁林
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.65,1:24:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这就去
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.19,1:24:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了吗？别去
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.16,1:24:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能向他投降
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.11,1:24:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了，哈利？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.39,1:24:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道什么了？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.16,1:24:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能听见是有原因的
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.74,1:24:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,听见魂器
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.40,1:24:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该早就想到了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.16,1:24:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你们应该也想到了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.52,1:24:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要跟你一起去 - 不行，你们得杀了那条蛇
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.19,1:24:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了蛇，就只剩他了！
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.18,1:26:06.67,Note,0,0,0,0,,（我在结束时打开）
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.57,1:26:12.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就要死了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.74,1:26:55.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,复活石
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.87,1:27:29.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直很勇敢，宝贝
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.37,1:27:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们怎么都在这儿？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.08,1:27:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们从未离开
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.96,1:27:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.59,1:27:54.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,疼吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.61,1:27:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,死？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.65,1:28:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,比睡着还快
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.77,1:28:06.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,只差一步了，儿子
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.36,1:28:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.95,1:28:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从来没想过要你们为我而死
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.78,1:28:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱姆斯，你刚有儿子…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.65,1:28:18.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会知道父母是为何牺牲的
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.16,1:28:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,总有一天，他会明白
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.24,1:28:36.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们会陪着我么？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.44,1:28:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到最后
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.92,1:28:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,别人看不见你们么？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.19,1:28:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,看不见
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.01,1:28:48.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在你心里
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.67,1:29:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,陪在我身边
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.05,1:29:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直都是
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.05,1:29:27.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还是没出现，主人
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.42,1:29:45.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为他会来
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.68,1:30:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利，不要！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.55,1:30:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么要来？ - 安静！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.90,1:30:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利·波特…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.81,1:30:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,大难不死的男孩儿…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.64,1:30:57.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,前来受死吧
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.03,1:31:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿瓦达索命！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:14.10,1:32:15.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你帮不了…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.37,1:32:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利，你真是好孩子
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.79,1:32:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,最最勇敢的男子汉！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.55,1:32:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:32:36.96,1:32:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,教授，那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.94,1:32:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我们无能为力的东西
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.46,1:32:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,伏地魔的一部分在这里等待死亡
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.27,1:32:52.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那这里到底是哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.93,1:32:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正想问你
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.63,1:32:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说我们是在哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:57.60,1:33:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,看样子像国王十字车站
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.86,1:33:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是更干净…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.67,1:33:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有火车
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.10,1:33:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,国王十字车站，真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.22,1:33:14.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是人们说的：“你的地盘”
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.01,1:33:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在应该知道你和伏地魔…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:18.74,1:33:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的命运紧紧缠绕在一起
Dialogue: 0,1:33:21.85,1:33:25.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,从多年前戈德里克山谷那一晚开始
Dialogue: 0,1:33:25.08,1:33:26.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说是真的了，教授
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.75,1:33:29.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的一部分活在我的体内，是吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.41,1:33:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾经在
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.84,1:33:35.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那一部分刚刚被伏地魔亲自摧毁了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.68,1:33:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是他无意间造就的魂器，哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:33:54.70,1:33:58.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我必须回去，是吗？ - 这由你做主
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.49,1:34:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我可以选择？ - 是的！
Dialogue: 0,1:34:02.43,1:34:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说我们在国王十字车站
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.26,1:34:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想如果你迫切要回去的话 应该会出现一列火车
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.43,1:34:13.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,它会把我带到哪儿呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:14.83,1:34:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,前方
Dialogue: 0,1:34:34.67,1:34:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,伏地魔拥有老魔杖？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.79,1:34:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.96,1:34:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那条蛇还活着？ - 是的
Dialogue: 0,1:34:44.40,1:34:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我没有武器可以杀它
Dialogue: 0,1:34:47.22,1:34:51.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,在霍格沃茨，那些需要帮助的人总能得到帮助，哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.75,1:34:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直自诩很善于措辞
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.78,1:35:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,以我的愚见，语言…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:00.65,1:35:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像用之不竭的魔法
Dialogue: 0,1:35:05.07,1:35:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以中伤他人，亦可抚慰忧伤
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.33,1:35:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我现在想…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.20,1:35:14.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我的原话稍作改动，变成
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.26,1:35:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,在霍格沃茨，那些值得帮助的人总能得到帮助
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.62,1:35:32.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要怜悯死者，哈利…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.59,1:35:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,怜悯活着的人
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.18,1:35:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其是那些…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:39.01,1:35:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,生命中没有爱的人
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.80,1:35:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,教授，我母亲的守护神…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:44.83,1:35:47.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,是只母鹿，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.58,1:35:50.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟斯内普教授的一样
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.95,1:35:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不觉得很奇怪么？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:54.49,1:35:56.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实要我说…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.37,1:35:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一点也不奇怪
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.04,1:36:02.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要走了，哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:36:03.76,1:36:05.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,教授？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:09.22,1:36:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是真实的吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:12.34,1:36:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是只是我脑海里的臆想？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.42,1:36:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然是你脑海里的臆想，哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:36:18.27,1:36:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,但为什么那就不能是真实的呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.42,1:36:29.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,教授？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.24,1:36:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该怎么做？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.44,1:36:36.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,教授？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.80,1:36:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,主人，我的主人，你受伤了？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:43.60,1:36:45.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我用不着你帮忙！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.91,1:37:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那男孩儿…死了没？
Dialogue: 0,1:37:14.83,1:37:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还活着么？
Dialogue: 0,1:37:17.43,1:37:18.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,德拉科还活着么？
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.03,1:37:47.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,死了
Dialogue: 0,1:39:14.61,1:39:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是谁？海格抱着的是谁？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:17.69,1:39:19.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳威，那是谁？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:20.17,1:39:21.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利·波特…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:23.82,1:39:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 死了！ - 不！不会的！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:26.80,1:39:28.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,安静！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:32.56,1:39:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,愚蠢！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:36.03,1:39:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利·波特死了！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:39.20,1:39:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,从今天起…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:42.15,1:39:45.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都得追随我
Dialogue: 0,1:39:56.02,1:39:58.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利波特死了！
Dialogue: 0,1:40:03.29,1:40:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在表明立场吧！
Dialogue: 0,1:40:08.28,1:40:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,要加入我的走上前…否则就死！
Dialogue: 0,1:40:20.48,1:40:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,德拉科！
Dialogue: 0,1:40:26.89,1:40:27.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,德拉科
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.69,1:40:32.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,德拉科
Dialogue: 0,1:40:36.35,1:40:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来
Dialogue: 0,1:40:50.41,1:40:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好，德拉科
Dialogue: 0,1:40:53.53,1:40:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常好！
Dialogue: 0,1:41:18.03,1:41:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈，比我期望的要糟糕啊
Dialogue: 0,1:41:25.16,1:41:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是哪位，年轻人？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:29.05,1:41:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳威·隆巴顿
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.66,1:41:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧纳威，我保证你会有用武之地的
Dialogue: 0,1:41:40.66,1:41:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有话要说
Dialogue: 0,1:41:48.81,1:41:53.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧纳威，我倒要听听你想说什么
Dialogue: 0,1:41:57.86,1:42:00.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哈利死了也没关系 - 别说了，纳威！
Dialogue: 0,1:42:00.14,1:42:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,每天都有人死！
Dialogue: 0,1:42:04.47,1:42:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友，家人…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:10.63,1:42:12.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.74,1:42:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚我们失去了哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:42:17.64,1:42:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他还在
Dialogue: 0,1:42:20.17,1:42:21.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们心里
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.02,1:42:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗雷德、莱姆斯…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:28.56,1:42:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,唐克斯…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:31.43,1:42:33.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都在
Dialogue: 0,1:42:34.58,1:42:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们没有白白牺牲！
Dialogue: 0,1:42:42.03,1:42:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你会！
Dialogue: 0,1:42:43.67,1:42:44.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你错了！
Dialogue: 0,1:42:45.78,1:42:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利是为我们而战
Dialogue: 0,1:42:47.81,1:42:49.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,为我们所有人！
Dialogue: 0,1:42:49.22,1:42:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没结束！
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.21,1:42:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,霹雳爆炸！
Dialogue: 0,1:43:06.22,1:43:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,回来战斗！回来！
Dialogue: 0,1:43:17.46,1:43:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都进城堡！
Dialogue: 0,1:43:19.23,1:43:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得杀了那只蛇
Dialogue: 0,1:43:20.66,1:43:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着毒牙！
Dialogue: 0,1:43:21.53,1:43:22.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳威！
Dialogue: 0,1:46:16.48,1:46:19.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许碰我女儿，贱人！
Dialogue: 0,1:46:52.47,1:46:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实你说对了…
Dialogue: 0,1:46:55.54,1:46:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟斯内普教授说那根魔杖不听你的
Dialogue: 0,1:46:57.76,1:46:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,它本来…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:01.03,1:47:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我杀了斯内普！
Dialogue: 0,1:47:02.82,1:47:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,可如果魔杖根本不属于斯内普呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:47:04.90,1:47:07.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果魔杖效忠的一直另有其人呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:47:08.07,1:47:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧，汤姆…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:09.37,1:47:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们开始的由我们来结束
Dialogue: 0,1:47:11.96,1:47:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,做个了断吧！
Dialogue: 0,1:50:59.00,1:51:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利！
Dialogue: 0,1:52:00.67,1:52:03.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,老魔杖为什么不听他的呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:52:05.46,1:52:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,老魔杖效忠的另有其人
Dialogue: 0,1:52:08.24,1:52:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他以为杀了斯内普，魔杖就会属于他
Dialogue: 0,1:52:11.19,1:52:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,但实际上…
Dialogue: 0,1:52:13.42,1:52:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔杖从来都不属于斯内普
Dialogue: 0,1:52:15.76,1:52:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,天文塔那晚，邓布利多是被德拉科解除武器的
Dialogue: 0,1:52:20.35,1:52:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,从那时起，魔杖就效忠于他
Dialogue: 0,1:52:25.42,1:52:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到那晚他被我解除武器
Dialogue: 0,1:52:30.07,1:52:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,在马尔福庄园
Dialogue: 0,1:52:31.77,1:52:33.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是说…
Dialogue: 0,1:52:35.57,1:52:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔杖属于我！
Dialogue: 0,1:52:39.39,1:52:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们该怎么处理？ - 我们？
Dialogue: 0,1:52:43.40,1:52:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说，那可是老魔杖啊
Dialogue: 0,1:52:45.39,1:52:47.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界上最厉害的魔杖
Dialogue: 0,1:52:48.12,1:52:51.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,有了它，就能战无不胜
Dialogue: 0,1:54:18.54,1:54:24.29,Note,0,0,0,0,,（19年后）
Dialogue: 0,1:55:14.90,1:55:16.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起走
Dialogue: 0,1:55:55.29,1:55:56.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 书包？ - 拿了
Dialogue: 0,1:55:57.27,1:55:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,毛衣？
Dialogue: 0,1:56:00.40,1:56:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会想你的
Dialogue: 0,1:56:02.85,1:56:04.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们来了
Dialogue: 0,1:56:19.97,1:56:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:56:21.49,1:56:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我被分到斯莱特林怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,1:56:26.34,1:56:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿不思·西弗勒斯·波特 你是以霍格沃茨两位校长的名字命名的
Dialogue: 0,1:56:33.91,1:56:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中之一就毕业于斯莱特林学院 他也是我见过的最勇敢的人
Dialogue: 0,1:56:41.08,1:56:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可是如果我… - 那么斯莱特林学院
Dialogue: 0,1:56:44.09,1:56:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会拥有一名优秀的小巫师
Dialogue: 0,1:56:48.60,1:56:49.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是…
Dialogue: 0,1:56:49.99,1:56:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你真的很在意，你可以选择格兰芬多
Dialogue: 0,1:56:54.25,1:56:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,分院帽会考虑你的选择
Dialogue: 0,1:56:57.29,1:56:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的吗？ - 真的
Dialogue: 0,1:57:03.87,1:57:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 准备好了？ - 好了
